{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":486040,"name":"B Melo","username":"B_Melo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/b2d939/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T08:07:01.778Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486040-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486040-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486040-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486040-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot on iOS will not load the Agent Computer. The app opens and my account is signed in, but the computer never finishes loading — the screen ends at “Something went wrong” with a Try Again button. Try Again fails every time. No bot can be used.\u003cbr\u003e\nLast working: 7 Sep 2026, early afternoon BST\u003cbr\u003e\nFirst failure: 7 Sep 2026, afternoon BST\u003cbr\u003e\nStill failing: 8 Sep 2026, 09:00 BST — roughly 20 hours continuous\u003cbr\u003e\nThis matches the staff-confirmed “Agent Computer stuck in an in-between state on the backend” reports (170661, 170843, 170897), where the computer could not be fixed from the client and had to be recovered server-side. Two further reports with the same symptoms were posted this morning within minutes of each other.\u003cbr\u003e\nPlease recover / rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486040-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486040-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on iOS.\u003cbr\u003e\n2.\tApp loads, account signed in.\u003cbr\u003e\n3.\tAgent Computer never finishes loading — “Something went wrong” appears.\u003cbr\u003e\n4.\tTap Try Again — same result.\u003cbr\u003e\n5.\tForce-quit and reopen — same result.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486040-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486040-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer loads and bots respond normally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486040-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486040-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/e/ee5e6b2df74dabcac4e72792b930fca149f19c5c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/y0HVBcYEtNaDvoMPXSRkBSghWiw.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_7700.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee5e6b2df74dabcac4e72792b930fca149f19c5c_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_7700.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"y0HVBcYEtNaDvoMPXSRkBSghWiw\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee5e6b2df74dabcac4e72792b930fca149f19c5c_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee5e6b2df74dabcac4e72792b930fca149f19c5c_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee5e6b2df74dabcac4e72792b930fca149f19c5c_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_7700.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e960×2079 53.4 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u0